Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.15,0:01:09.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Typical of Victor Von Doom to build a 30-foot statue of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:12.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it's obviously aimed at first-time visitors...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:16.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,to create feelings of smallness, inadequacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:19.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good thing it ain't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.99,0:01:23.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, what are we doing here? This guy's fast-food, strip-mall science.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:26.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,This wasn't our first stop, in case you forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:30.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, Victor's not that bad. He's just a little larger than life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:43.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,My research suggests that exposure to a high-energy cosmic storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:47.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,borne on solar winds might have triggered the evolution of early planetary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:53.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,In six weeks, another cloud with the same elemental profile...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,will pass Earth's orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:02:00.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,A study conducted in space could fundamentally advance our knowledge...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:03.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,about the structure of the human genome, cure countless diseases...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:07.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,extend human life, give kids a chance to live longer, stronger, healthier
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:10.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Turn it off, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:12.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think I have explained my proposal fully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I think you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:17.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Same old Reed, always stretching, reaching for the stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:19.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,with the weight of the world on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:21.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,But dreams don't pay the bills, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:28.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,You remember, when we were in school we talked about working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:30.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what I was about to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:33.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,The storm is deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:35.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,But the shields on your station's control room...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:38.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,are designed to protect any occupants inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.28,0:02:43.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,So it's not just my money you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:45.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's my toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:49.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me, if NASA doesn't trust you, then why should l?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:56.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my job, to stay a step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:00.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,To know what other men don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:01.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:03.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, this is business, just work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's right, Ben. It is just business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:11.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you both know my Director of Genetic Research, Susan Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:17.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,One more thing he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:19.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Susie. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:23.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so nice to see you. How's Debbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Great. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:29.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How have you been? - Never better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:33.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't going to be a problem, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. - Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:36.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:40.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you're just in time to hear the great Reed Richards...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:43.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,ask me for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:47.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, you made a lot of folks at MlT feel like a junior high science fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you'll excuse me if I savour the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:55.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You back this mission and I'll sign over a fair percentage of any application.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:57.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,The number's 75%.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,And its applications and patents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:01.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What about his first-born? - Ben...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:03.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:07.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,25% of a billion is enough to keep the lights on for a while, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:11.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe even pay off your fourth mortgage on the Baxter Building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:14.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:25.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then. To our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:33.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's funny how things turn out, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:36.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:42.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,He knew about NASA. Maybe he made the call to shut us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, think about all the people we can help if this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:48.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, we got what we wanted. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:51.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,A few days in space, it'll be great. What's the worst that can happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:05:00.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,If Reed's right, this little trip could double our stock offerings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And if he's not... - Reed's always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:06.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good thing he doesn't always know what he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:18.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, you should know those solar winds have been picking up speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I factored them into my coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right, of course you did. In theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a little different once you're out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can assure you l - When are we leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:30.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be scheduling the launch...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:33.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,so you can call me in the morning for resources and crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:37.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I think I remember the number. - It's been changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:46.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,As far as crew, I was hoping Ben could pilot the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:50.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,We already have a pilot on our payroll, but you're welcome to ride shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:52.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember my brother, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.41,0:06:11.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't do it. Cannot do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:15.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,External SRBs, orbital system engines, it's just like the shuttle you flew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:18.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! I cannot take orders from the underwear model.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:21.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on now, Ben. - That wingnut washed out of NASA...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:24.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,for sneaking two Victoria's Secret wannabes into a flight simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Youthful high spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:30.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,They crashed it into a wall. A flight simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,When have I ever asked you to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,you absolutely said you could not do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:38.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I had it at four. - Well, this makes five.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:50.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Attention, all personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:53.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Commencing launch sequence in six hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:55.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I miss you already, Debs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain on the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:04.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Digital camera: $254. Memory stick: $59.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:07.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,The look on your hard-ass former CO's face...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:10.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,when he finds out he's your junior officer:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:11.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:16.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can handle the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can even handle Mr. Blond Ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I don't know whether I should be flying or doing Swan Lake in these suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:27.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I mean, who the hell came up with these? - Victor did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:31.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,The synthetics act as a second skin, adapting to your body's individual needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:34.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,See, now that means it keeps the hot stuff hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,and it keeps the cool stuff cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:43.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Material made from self-regulating unstable molecules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:46.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been working on a formula for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great minds think alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:55.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Here you go, Ben. - Thanks, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:56.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,ETA until cosmic event: nine hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:34.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're good, maybe next time Daddy'll let you drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:37.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,You keep talking and there won't be a next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:44.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Long way from the projection booth at the Hayden Planetarium, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:51.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:56.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can monitor the cloud's approach and observe the tests from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:58.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,The shields on the station should protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:03.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Should?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Ben? Getting paranoid in your old age?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:11.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's start loading those samples. Get your suit ready, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:15.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I see you're still doing all the heavy lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:20.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should have stayed in the lab. Fieldwork never suited you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,He does the talking, I do the walking. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,So take a walk, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:31.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, if you'll all excuse me, I need to borrow Susan for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:43.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please tell me your guy's not trying to rekindle things with my sister again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:46.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course not. It's strictly business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, his eyes say differently, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:54.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two hearts got busted last time. Maybe she's not over it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:57.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow, Dr. Phil, that's deep. Let's think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:01.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got Victor, more money than God, stud of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:06.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you got Reed, world's dumbest smart guy, worth less than a postage stamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:09.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a real toss-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:11.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't trouble your tiny little mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:13.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't wander off now, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Securing airlock chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:40.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Surprised I agreed to Reed's proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I understand the business reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:45.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, when you're looking at your future...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:48.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,it doesn't hurt to find closure about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:55.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan, every man dreams he'll meet a woman he can give the world to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,In my case, it's not just a metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.29,0:11:06.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Opening viewing station shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:43.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Event threshold in T-minus 9 minutes, 47 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:46.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's impossible. It should be seven hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've been together two years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:57.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been a good two years, Victor. The company's accomplished so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right, of course, the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:04.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, you see, I've come to realise that all the accomplishments in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:07.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,mean nothing without someone to share them with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:11.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've lived my life unafraid of taking big steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:14.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to take the biggest step of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:19.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Victor. - lf it helps, think of this as a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:22.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Victor, l - I have four words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:27.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Four little words that can change our lives forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,The cloud is accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:32.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got minutes until it hits, not hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, that storm is deadly. We need to abort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:38.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get a grip, Reed. We didn't come all this way to lose our nerve at the first glitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just close the shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ben is still out there. - So reel him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:45.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we came here to do a job, so let's do it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:50.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, Reed's right. We have less than six minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:55.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ben, you need to get inside now. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:58.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't done arranging your flowers yet, egghead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:59.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:10.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, I'm not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, you gotta jump. It's the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:20.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - Closing the shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't just leave them out there. - Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:27.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't help them any more than I can. - I can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:44.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ben, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Johnny, get ready to close the portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:46.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wake up. Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:50.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine, big boy. How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:52.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where am l?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:55.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back on Earth. We're in quarantine. Victor's medical facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:57.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed? Sue?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:15:00.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're fine. Everybody else is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:03.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:08.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I swear to you, Ben. They've done everything humanly possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:10.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,The best plastic surgeons in the world are here, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:11.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You had the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:14.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Give me that mirror. - I don't know if that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:18.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They said the shock alone - I said give me that goddamn mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:21.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Ben, just be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:29.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the doctors just couldn't do anything to fix your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.43,0:15:36.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hi. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:39.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice do. I'm liking the grandpa look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:41.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:02.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How's she doing? - Stable and her vitals are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Blood panels show no irradiation. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:09.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You'll step up this protocol every - Every four hours, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:11.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,We know what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another day of observation and you're all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:17.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. More flowers from Mr. Von Doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's allergic to orchids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:25.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put the sunflowers by her bed, they're her favourites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:45.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, Victor...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:47.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,the bank would like to congratulate you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:50.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,on the fastest freefall since the Depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't even give your stock away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:53.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ned, you know I can turn this around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:56.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you're going to have to, Victor, or we pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:00.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.73,0:17:02.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're enjoying this, aren't you, Ned?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:08.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,One week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:22.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where do we think we're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know if we've noticed...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:27.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,but the sickest runs this side of the Alps are right outside that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:29.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've noticed, but there are rules here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't leave until we - Until we've finish the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:36.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, I've never been good with rules. You let me know how those come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:40.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you wanna help me with this zipper? - You know, this is not a ski resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not yet. Luckily, Grandma still sends care packages, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:47.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, it's amazing, for an 80-year-old woman, you'd be surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:50.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You are trouble. - Trouble is my middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:51.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you. So are you. And I'm not afraid to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:55.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, you feel a little feverish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I've never felt better in my life. My God, you smell good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:00.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, when do you get off work?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- 4:00, but l - Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:05.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You meet me at 4:01 at the top of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:10.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,That'll give you a minute to freshen up. This is yours, that's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nurses!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:19.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long was I out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:20.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three days. Man, I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:26.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How are you feeling? - Solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:30.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That was a close one, though, huh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:32.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was that about? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:35.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:39.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been going over the figures again and again and they all add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand. Maybe I should have aborted
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:46.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, it was a freak of nature. You couldn't have possibly predicted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:47.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, you live through something like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:55.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,it really makes you appreciate having the right woman in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:59.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, you and Debbie are perfect. - I'm not talking about Debbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:03.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:05.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's got a good thing with Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:07.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's smart, he's powerful, he's successful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:09.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you should date him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:12.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, she ended up with the right guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:15.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Things worked out for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:21.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do I have to do everything myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:43.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. I think you should stay to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,The left might give you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:48.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I think we should drop, like, 10 more feet. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last one down springs for room service!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:20:00.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my future wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:31.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, no more kid's stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:33.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:42.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks! You're pretty good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.41,0:20:47.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, you're on fire. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:23.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Care to join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:34.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can only stay for one drink 'cause I have to meet Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:36.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, wouldn't want to keep Vic waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:39.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:40.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:45.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great! Maybe you can join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:47.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's the lPO now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:49.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's falling. We're looking at low 20s.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:52.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a good number considering the fallout from
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:53.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,From Reed's disaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:57.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get me on the a.m. shows, Larry King, the cover of the Journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:01.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to do something about this scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.32,0:22:05.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make sure they only shoot me from my left side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.49,0:22:08.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, the scar's tracking well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:10.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,People seem to think it humanises you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:14.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,And that's a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:19.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, maybe you should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.09,0:22:21.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.55,0:22:23.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,First, I have some unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:26.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,A deal that needs closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:29.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, I have always wondered, why Sue?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:32.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could have any other woman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.31,0:22:35.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why. Because I could have any other woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.39,0:22:39.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, let me tell the story. - No, let him tell the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:50.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You all right? - Yeah, bad shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:53.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I better go lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.37,0:22:55.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:58.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.85,0:23:16.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, you feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:18.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.27,0:23:20.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.61,0:23:24.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's...good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:29.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,You always had a way with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.79,0:23:37.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. I should be going because...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:40.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to meet Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:43.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy for you and Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:46.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're really happy for me and Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.38,0:23:49.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can tell you guys are enjoying what was the best part of our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.05,0:23:51.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Which was? - Passion...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.47,0:23:54.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,for science.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:58.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're such a dork, Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.85,0:24:00.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never got it...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:03.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- and you never will... - Well, what did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.23,0:24:05.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,...unless it's explained to you in quantum physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:06.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to let you know that l
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:09.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been two years, and all you can say is that you're happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:11.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,for me and some other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.41,0:24:13.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor may be a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:16.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,But at least he's not afraid to fight for what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:18.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nice to be wanted sometimes, Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.83,0:24:23.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,To be seen and heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.88,0:24:28.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.88,0:24:31.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.05,0:24:33.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, you can't? Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:35.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue, look at your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.12,0:25:00.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are never gonna believe what just happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.79,0:25:01.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.29,0:25:05.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I can explain this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.86,0:25:36.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,It has to be the cloud. It's fundamentally altered our DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.32,0:25:37.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's not jump to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.99,0:25:40.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need a massive amount of evidence before making that leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:42.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.09,0:25:56.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, picture that, but everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.43,0:25:59.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:01.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.56,0:26:05.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,The cloud has fundamentally altered our DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:09.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cool! - We need to find Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:11.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you know what, guys? I think I was flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.49,0:26:19.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I said, cut it out, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.08,0:26:21.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.62,0:26:23.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ben, it's Reed. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.87,0:26:25.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right. - All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:26.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes. - God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.83,0:26:28.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- God? - What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.25,0:26:29.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Sue, do you know the code?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.46,0:26:30.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:39.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.05,0:26:41.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You all right, Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.18,0:26:43.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does somebody have keys to these doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.18,0:26:45.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.73,0:26:48.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just break the glass. It can't be that thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.98,0:26:51.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me another couple of seconds, guys. I almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.36,0:27:33.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.53,0:27:40.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.49,0:27:42.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:47.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.83,0:27:51.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.04,0:27:53.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.42,0:27:54.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, are you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.09,0:27:56.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Just a few scrapes, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.84,0:27:58.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.22,0:28:01.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's had some kind of reaction to exposure from the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.93,0:28:04.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,We all have different symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.43,0:28:05.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Symptoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:08.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Victor, I should have - Just find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.48,0:28:14.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anybody got any ideas where the big guy's going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.03,0:28:19.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.61,0:29:00.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.58,0:29:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Little buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.50,0:29:10.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Operator?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.42,0:29:16.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello? - Debs?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.79,0:29:18.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's me. - Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:21.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? You sound a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.09,0:29:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Listen, I need you to come out front. - Out front?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.60,0:29:27.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're home, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.97,0:29:28.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:33.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:38.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got a little one for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.07,0:29:43.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:48.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:49.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:29:53.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer for a sec, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.17,0:29:57.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a bit of a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.42,0:29:59.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Honey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.63,0:30:00.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Debs...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.97,0:30:04.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,remember when we used to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.63,0:30:07.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,together forever no matter what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.35,0:30:09.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.89,0:30:12.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:14.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Baby, you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:29.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.33,0:30:33.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Deb, it's me. It's still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.25,0:30:34.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was the accident. Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:37.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! Don't touch me! - Debs!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:45.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm calling the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.05,0:30:47.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.26,0:30:49.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I saw him. It's that guy over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.98,0:31:00.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, so he was there last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.36,0:31:02.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Debbie's gonna meet us on the other side of the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.21,0:31:18.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.96,0:31:21.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,"A few days in space. It'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.21,0:31:24.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the worst that could happen?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.55,0:31:29.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.93,0:31:33.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not afraid of me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.73,0:31:40.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:43.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:31:59.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.63,0:32:03.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think you've got problems? You take a good look, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.96,0:32:06.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,How bad could it be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.26,0:32:09.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.68,0:32:14.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, pal. Take it easy. No, don't go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:16.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I said stop, you fruitcake!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.18,0:32:18.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Come close.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.64,0:32:21.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's further. Come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.15,0:32:24.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I said, stop! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.97,0:32:50.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.91,0:33:16.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.16,0:33:19.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna be scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.75,0:33:21.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Fine! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.84,0:33:33.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:36.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back in your vehicle. We'll tell you when you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.76,0:33:39.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What do we do now? - We're not going to get past these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.06,0:33:41.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.98,0:33:48.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the truck, pal. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.19,0:33:51.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,A little help, here? You wanna hit the button, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:53.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.32,0:33:57.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue, your clothes. Lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.16,0:33:59.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:01.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is so wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.09,0:34:12.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wow, you've been working out. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.63,0:34:15.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.76,0:34:21.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.98,0:34:23.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now just...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.98,0:34:26.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just put the man in the seat down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.73,0:34:28.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.15,0:34:35.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any more great ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.61,0:34:38.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you strip down and have a 100 people stare at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.20,0:34:39.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sue. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.54,0:34:46.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.29,0:34:50.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.17,0:34:54.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:35:01.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, now just back away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.98,0:35:06.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I want you to put your hands on your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.11,0:35:16.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,954 approaching scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.74,0:35:18.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe you made me do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.82,0:35:21.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got through, didn't we? Just find Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.42,0:35:30.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.76,0:35:39.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.14,0:36:27.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.68,0:36:28.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.44,0:36:30.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.56,0:37:14.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.20,0:37:22.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.57,0:38:04.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get down on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.41,0:38:07.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get down on the ground now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.71,0:38:13.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.57,0:39:29.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I swear to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.87,0:39:32.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will do everything in my power...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.41,0:39:34.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,until there is not a breath left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:38.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're going to be Ben again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.72,0:39:50.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told you I felt fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.51,0:39:53.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are your ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.56,0:39:59.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are some folks outside that want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.56,0:40:01.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're not going public with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.36,0:40:03.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're scientists, not celebrities.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.23,0:40:04.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too late, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.07,0:40:06.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.20,0:40:09.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,...when a New York Fire Department ladder truck...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.20,0:40:10.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,...became part of the tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:13.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,But the rescue itselfis not the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.04,0:40:16.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,One of the four stretched to an amazing length...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.62,0:40:19.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what they're calling you. "The Fantastic Four."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.04,0:40:22.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cool. - No, wait! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.42,0:40:23.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.63,0:40:25.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, we should think this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.76,0:40:27.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's great. Brainstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.68,0:40:33.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back here, right now. Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.77,0:40:38.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.60,0:40:42.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.11,0:40:44.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which one of you is the leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.86,0:40:46.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,That would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.57,0:40:48.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.41,0:40:52.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, son. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.50,0:41:03.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,During our recent mission to the Von Doom space station...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.59,0:41:08.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,we were exposed to as yet unidentified radioactive energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.80,0:41:10.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happened on the bridge? - How can you stretch?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.55,0:41:12.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Were you really on fire? - ls it true you can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.47,0:41:14.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm working on it. It's actually really difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.55,0:41:16.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, actually, we do not know much more than you do at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.89,0:41:21.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, Larry King just cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.60,0:41:23.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there's a bigger story.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.94,0:41:30.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, here they come now. You had to see it to believe it, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.65,0:41:33.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,The man...named The Fantastic Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.28,0:41:36.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll be going directly to our lab to diagnose our symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.33,0:41:38.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Symptoms? Is this some kind of disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.16,0:41:40.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. It's not a disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.66,0:41:44.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,If having special powers is a disease, then, yeah, we got it bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.71,0:41:47.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, that thing doesn't look so fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.34,0:41:49.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben Grimm is a genuine American hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.67,0:41:52.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,What he means is, every team needs a mascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.34,0:41:57.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,A new day is dawning. The day of The Fantastic Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.81,0:42:02.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:05.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,We went up to space to find a way to understand DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.36,0:42:08.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,cure disease, save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.40,0:42:12.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, now it's our DNA, our disease, our lives on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:16.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.83,0:42:20.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is how you turn things around?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.66,0:42:24.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,These freaks on the front page? Your company's in the obituaries?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.62,0:42:26.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was planning to use the publicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.21,0:42:29.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,The board's in agreement, the bank's lost enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:32.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wait a minute. - It's too late, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.22,0:42:36.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much money I've invested in this company?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.26,0:42:37.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.35,0:42:40.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't a negotiation. It's a notification.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.43,0:42:43.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're pulling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.35,0:43:28.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is all that for you, Dr. Richards?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.56,0:43:29.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.94,0:43:36.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ben, smile. They want to like you, Ben. Say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.74,0:43:42.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't do drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.88,0:43:56.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to the Baxter, Dr. Richards.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.80,0:43:58.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got the usual for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.01,0:44:00.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good to have you back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.80,0:44:02.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Willie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.89,0:44:06.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,We had a tough year.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.31,0:44:08.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like nine straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.20,0:44:24.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Either we're moving really fast or not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.04,0:44:34.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.10,0:44:46.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,How come Ben can't turn it on and off like we can?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.60,0:44:48.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what we're here to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.52,0:44:50.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, if it happened to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.69,0:44:53.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? You mean, like, we won't be able to turn it off, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.44,0:44:55.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,That would save time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.61,0:44:58.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't really wanna walk around on fire for the rest of your life, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.70,0:45:00.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- ls that a trick question? - Grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.45,0:45:03.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Am I the only guy who thinks this is cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.66,0:45:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should stay here until we can define the extent of our changes...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.95,0:45:10.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,and figure out how to reverse them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.38,0:45:17.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I have to warn you, it's gonna be a little crowded in some areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.68,0:45:26.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.64,0:45:31.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Reed, I think you might be bringing your work home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.10,0:45:35.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let me show you guys where you'll be staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.27,0:45:37.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Busy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.03,0:45:47.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Von Doom, would you like to comment on the recent failure of your lPO?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.74,0:45:49.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about the rumours of a takeover?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.94,0:46:13.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,God, I was so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.77,0:46:16.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor. I'm sorry I didn't get a chance to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.65,0:46:18.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.44,0:46:20.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,No apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.65,0:46:24.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've arranged for your things to be moved to one of my condos.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.95,0:46:26.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll have round-the-clock care.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.70,0:46:28.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. That's very generous of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.04,0:46:31.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I think I should stay here with my brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.33,0:46:34.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,until we get a handle on things.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.42,0:46:37.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan, I think you should let my doctors have a look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.67,0:46:40.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:44.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to wonder the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.18,0:46:48.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,How much do you know about what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.64,0:46:49.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.81,0:46:51.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to run tests to see the extent of the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.10,0:46:55.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you let me know what I can do. We're all in this together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.07,0:47:06.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.07,0:47:11.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say I'm sorry the mission didn't go as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.25,0:47:14.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't go as planned? It was a catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.29,0:47:17.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You ruined the lives of four people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.58,0:47:20.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, we're both to blame. I told you to abort.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.46,0:47:21.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Abort?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.67,0:47:24.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I put my company, my name, billions of dollars on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.97,0:47:27.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will not let you make me look like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.72,0:47:28.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, if we can understand
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.14,0:47:32.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna understand it! This isn't one of your science projects!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.47,0:47:34.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanna fix it. Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.10,0:47:37.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.49,0:47:44.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.90,0:47:47.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,No problem, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.91,0:47:51.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just pay your damn electric bill and get to work on finding a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.53,0:48:28.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's heating up from his core.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.70,0:48:30.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,And his vitals are completely normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.78,0:48:33.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we're going to identify the source of the mutation...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.04,0:48:36.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,we need to isolate your recombinant DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.20,0:48:38.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,so we can activate positional genomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.67,0:48:41.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to do a physical in order to see what got zapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.63,0:48:43.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you just say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.30,0:48:46.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,His internal organs are completely solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.84,0:48:51.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.80,0:48:53.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I used to smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.60,0:48:57.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not invisibility per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.77,0:49:01.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should be able to bend light around other objects, even people...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:04.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,if you could control your emotional state better.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.48,0:49:05.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.73,0:49:09.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm saying, if you had a little more self-control, you could locate the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.32,0:49:12.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you remember your exact emotions on the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.66,0:49:13.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.66,0:49:15.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.49,0:49:17.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Frustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.75,0:49:20.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Is there any way to duplicate that feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.25,0:49:21.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some memory or...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.17,0:49:25.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.55,0:49:27.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You feel anything? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.09,0:49:30.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.51,0:49:38.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's hotter than I anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.39,0:49:40.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, Johnny, back it down. - I can go hotter!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.35,0:49:42.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, just back it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.70,0:49:55.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Johnny, back it down right now! - Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.12,0:50:04.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz kill! You guys are cramping my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.88,0:50:07.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, you were at 4,000 Kelvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.30,0:50:09.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any hotter and you're approaching supernova.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.63,0:50:11.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sweet! - No, not sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.72,0:50:13.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the temperature of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.64,0:50:15.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not only could you kill yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.47,0:50:17.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,but you could set fire to Earth's atmosphere...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.26,0:50:19.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,and destroy all human life as we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.43,0:50:22.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it. Supernova: bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.57,0:50:31.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's that coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.33,0:50:40.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm so sorry. Are you okay? - Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.83,0:50:42.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.54,0:50:43.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.04,0:50:48.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You probably thought that was some form of latent hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.46,0:50:50.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,What in the world would give me that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.39,0:50:58.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, you broke up with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.18,0:51:00.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you kidding? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.64,0:51:03.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I distinctly remember, you walked out my door, ergo
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.69,0:51:06.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was ready for the next step, you weren't. Ergo, I walked.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.90,0:51:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think it was a little bit more complicated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.02,0:51:12.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to share an apartment. What was so complicated about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.40,0:51:16.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There were a lot of variables to consider. - No, there weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.36,0:51:20.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,There was you and me. There were no variables, no math.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.45,0:51:22.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was actually the simplest thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.79,0:51:24.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,But like always, Reed, your head got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.75,0:51:26.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, it didn't. - Then what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.30,0:51:32.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you feel anything when I left?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.67,0:51:36.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you feel anything right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.43,0:51:40.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.97,0:51:45.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we have a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.78,0:52:00.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,So what's the prognosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.78,0:52:05.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your tissue, your organs, your entire biophysical structure is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.29,0:52:07.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every system is still functioning somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.29,0:52:09.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,And it's changing into?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.96,0:52:11.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.59,0:52:14.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some kind of organic-metallic alloy...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.13,0:52:18.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,stronger than titanium or carbon steel, harder than diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.97,0:52:21.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like the shields Reed said would protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.94,0:52:28.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.31,0:52:31.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the infection could be complete in two, maybe three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.11,0:52:33.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean complete?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.69,0:52:35.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wish I could tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.36,0:52:38.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't pretend to know what we're dealing with here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.49,0:52:41.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll have to notify the CDC.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.66,0:52:43.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Centre for Disease Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.62,0:52:44.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:47.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,If this thing is contagious, we may have a big problem on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.21,0:52:50.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're talking about an epidemic here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.25,0:52:52.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.50,0:52:55.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.42,0:52:58.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the face of a billion-dollar company.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.34,0:53:02.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to keep this confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.14,0:53:07.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, this disease is progressive, degenerative. I have to notify someone
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.18,0:53:09.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's terrible news.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.69,0:53:19.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I think I'll get a second opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.39,0:53:51.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our uniforms were exposed to the storm, like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.06,0:53:53.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,So they can transform like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.31,0:53:57.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Becoming invisible, changing size on demand or remaining impervious to flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.03,0:54:00.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys look like an '80s rock band.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.32,0:54:02.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, Ben, this material stretches.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.74,0:54:05.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can figure out a way to make it fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.41,0:54:07.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be caught dead wearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.29,0:54:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love these costumes. They're missing something, though. Needs, like, spice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.62,0:54:11.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're not costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.87,0:54:14.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't use your powers in public, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.29,0:54:17.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You guys are worse than NASA. - You could burn somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.63,0:54:19.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's missing a utility belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.18,0:54:26.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here you go, there's your change.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.39,0:54:29.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I help you, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.56,0:54:33.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, my. - It's Sue Storm, it's the lnvisible Woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.52,0:54:36.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue Storm, it is you. Listen, my kid loves you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.28,0:54:47.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm doing this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.33,0:54:58.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, we really can't go outside anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.88,0:55:01.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are on the cover of every publication from People
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.30,0:55:05.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm here, let's make this quick. I got a lot of places to go today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.26,0:55:07.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. I don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.14,0:55:11.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, it's imperative that we stay inside for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.81,0:55:15.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, but when you said that last time, my brain heard "a week."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.23,0:55:17.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, it's too dangerous for you to be in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.52,0:55:18.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've been saying that for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.90,0:55:21.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,What worries me is that our powers are evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.23,0:55:22.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.44,0:55:26.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am so close to flying, guys, I can taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.24,0:55:28.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't fly. - Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.24,0:55:30.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, can you put that napkin out?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.49,0:55:31.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.95,0:55:35.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,So what's going on, Reed? How're you going to cure us?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.17,0:55:38.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to build a machine to recreate the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.46,0:55:42.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,The cosmic rays will travel from this generator to this chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.17,0:55:44.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What, no pop-ups?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.84,0:55:48.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- lf I can reverse the wave signal - lt'll return us back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.35,0:55:54.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. But what are the risks?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.35,0:55:58.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even a small miscalculation could increase our symptoms exponentially...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.56,0:55:59.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,or perhaps even kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.98,0:56:02.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, dying. That's bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.19,0:56:05.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I say we just let sleeping dogs lie, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.45,0:56:07.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,So how long till this contraption's up and running?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.95,0:56:09.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know, it's hard to say. - How long, Reed?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.95,0:56:11.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know. - You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.87,0:56:14.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You don't want this to get worse. - Worse than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.12,0:56:19.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, look, we're gonna be stuck here for a while, so let's just try and get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.89,0:56:37.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You could knock! - Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.51,0:57:14.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:22.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,More bad news for Von Doom lndustries today as Ned Cecil announced...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.98,0:57:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,that his group ofinvestors would seek to gain control...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.40,0:57:27.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,of Victor Von Doom 's numerous technology companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.03,0:57:30.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Earlier, the lPO was pulled from the market...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.32,0:57:32.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,after the steady decline of its projected opening price.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.20,0:57:37.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Von Doom lndustries was never able to overcome the negative publicity...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.23,0:58:00.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.88,0:58:27.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.76,0:58:34.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.18,0:58:40.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's with these lights, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.39,0:58:43.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,About the lPO, no hard feelings, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.52,0:58:45.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.32,0:58:54.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, you could always move back to Latveria.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.11,0:58:56.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Start fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.03,0:58:59.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's where you belong, the old country.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.22,0:59:16.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing personal, Ned.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.35,0:59:20.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.32,0:59:35.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,...assassinated the competition everywhere this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.07,0:59:40.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Truly unbelievable. The crowd is going nuts here at the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.33,0:59:43.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tell you, if there's anybody out there who can do what these guys do...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.83,0:59:46.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,we dare you to come on down here. Look at this spread-eagle...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.75,0:59:49.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,no arm, back of the seat. Motorbike grab, landed...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.50,0:59:50.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.98,1:00:12.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, pretty boy, let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.99,1:00:19.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's your hot sister and the monster?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.62,1:00:23.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.26,1:00:42.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.47,1:00:45.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you all to make a lot ofnoise now for a very special guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.60,1:00:50.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Johnny Storm from The Fantastic Four!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:00:58.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at that lift!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.79,1:01:05.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.62,1:01:09.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, Johnny, come on. That's old school.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.83,1:01:11.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Show us something new.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.75,1:01:14.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something new.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.96,1:01:17.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.93,1:01:27.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Johnny, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.39,1:01:29.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is he flying?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.65,1:01:31.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.03,1:01:44.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.25,1:01:50.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm okay, I'm all right, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.83,1:01:52.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's okay! He's all right!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.92,1:01:55.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny Storm, ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.71,1:01:59.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to give you props, Johnny! You were on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.89,1:02:13.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He didn't. - Oh, yes, he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.65,1:02:16.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Flame Boy never listens. - What did he do to his uniform?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.07,1:02:21.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, I've gotta ask you about this outfit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.40,1:02:23.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's sort of Armani meets astronaut.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.57,1:02:25.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,So what are your superhero names?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.45,1:02:28.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,They call me The Human Torch. Ladies call me Torch.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.33,1:02:31.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about the rest of the team?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.16,1:02:33.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's the lnvisible Girl. - Girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.17,1:02:36.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about your leader, Reed Richards? I hear you call him Mr. Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.63,1:02:38.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Could've been worse. - I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.21,1:02:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it true what they say about him that he can expand any part ofhis anatomy?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.93,1:02:46.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I've always found him to be a little limp.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.22,1:02:50.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that? What do you call that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.81,1:02:52.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it. The Thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.89,1:02:55.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you think this is bad, you should ha ve seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.40,1:02:57.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Now I'm gonna go kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.57,1:03:06.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.29,1:03:16.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Johnny! - Can we talk about this later, guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.21,1:03:18.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. We can't talk about this later. - We can do this at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.55,1:03:20.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you thinking? - Where's my ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.02,1:03:34.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think that's funny, Pebbles?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.44,1:03:35.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Johnny! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.56,1:03:37.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gave us names? You don't think.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.90,1:03:40.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,So now you're the face of The Fantastic Four?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.19,1:03:42.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,A face that's about to be broken!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.24,1:03:43.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, this isn't permanent, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.86,1:03:45.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to be careful until we're normal again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.07,1:03:48.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if I don't wanna be normal? I didn't turn into a monster!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.37,1:03:50.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.42,1:04:01.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you just...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.59,1:04:03.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.76,1:04:05.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's it, Tinkerbell! - No, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.80,1:04:08.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna fly? Then fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.10,1:04:17.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, guys! Ben, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.94,1:04:19.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see if we can get blood from a stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.11,1:04:22.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Bring it, burnout!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.23,1:04:23.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,You two need a time-out!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.70,1:04:28.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Talk to blockhead, he started it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.36,1:04:30.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care. Damn it, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.49,1:04:33.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.75,1:04:35.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.50,1:04:41.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,You need to control yourself and think before you act.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.92,1:04:45.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but see, that's your problem. You always think, you never act.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.34,1:04:48.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if we got these powers for a reason? What if it's like some higher calling?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.89,1:04:51.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,A higher calling? Like getting girls and making money?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.30,1:04:52.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is there any higher?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.01,1:04:55.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what, Reed? This is who we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.93,1:04:57.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Accept it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.35,1:05:00.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or better yet, enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.98,1:05:08.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, Ben, slow down. He didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.66,1:05:11.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know Johnny. He's always been a hothead.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.78,1:05:14.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,It ain't him. It's them!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.79,1:05:17.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't live like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.66,1:05:19.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just give Reed a little more time. You know how he works.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.12,1:05:22.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Analysing every little step before he takes one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.63,1:05:25.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's easy for you to be patient. - No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.21,1:05:28.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought I was done waiting for Reed, but l...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.22,1:05:34.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're all in this together, Ben. - Together?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.85,1:05:39.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Susie, look at me. You got no idea what l'd...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.31,1:05:44.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,What I'd give to be invisible.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.08,1:06:01.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.92,1:06:05.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna pick up a few things...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.59,1:06:07.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,for some friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.61,1:06:26.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.80,1:06:57.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.26,1:06:59.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Ben Grimm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.97,1:07:02.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,The first mook from Brooklyn to go into outer space.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.94,1:07:04.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,So pay him some respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.77,1:07:06.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just give me the usual and I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.94,1:07:07.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.11,1:07:11.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Make it a double. - Make it a triple.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.82,1:07:16.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Put it on my tab, Ernie. - All right, Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.70,1:07:17.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.45,1:07:19.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.29,1:07:26.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.42,1:07:28.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,If there's a God, he hates me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.92,1:07:31.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,She is not so into hate.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.68,1:07:35.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you could see me, you wouldn't be saying that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.05,1:07:37.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then let me see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.68,1:07:39.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can l?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.19,1:07:46.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Careful. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.50,1:08:10.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,So sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.67,1:08:18.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, being different isn't always a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.56,1:08:23.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Trust me. This ain't one of them times.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.06,1:08:27.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not if you don't want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.52,1:08:32.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right, Ernie, I'm out of here. - I'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.32,1:08:33.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,See you later, Benny.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.16,1:08:42.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Alicia, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.92,1:08:49.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ernie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.76,1:09:01.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed got what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.81,1:09:03.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,And everything he wanted...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.77,1:09:06.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,he took from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.61,1:09:14.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to take it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.95,1:09:21.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,But first, I need to get rid of his bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.26,1:09:38.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,This seat taken?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.84,1:09:41.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.89,1:09:44.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.06,1:09:47.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were worried about me? That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.31,1:09:50.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let me buy you something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.98,1:09:55.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like you could use the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.24,1:10:01.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.54,1:10:11.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I was just resting my eyes. - So I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.67,1:10:14.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,The new readouts look very promising.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.30,1:10:16.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not promising enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.80,1:10:18.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,When are the next tests?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.72,1:10:21.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've run out of plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.09,1:10:24.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I was thinking maybe...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.35,1:10:29.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's always me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.73,1:10:31.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. It's too soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.69,1:10:34.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Reed? - I should get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.02,1:10:37.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You need a break. - Sue, not now, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.90,1:10:39.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.95,1:10:44.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember our first date here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.87,1:10:47.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,God, I was nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.70,1:10:51.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I bribed the projectionist $10 to keep the place open late.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.62,1:10:54.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really? I gave him $20.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.88,1:10:55.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.25,1:10:57.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No way. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.17,1:11:01.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't want that night to end.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.22,1:11:08.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were right. It wasn't complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.18,1:11:10.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wasn't ready to...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.23,1:11:14.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You always talked about how you kind of liked the man...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.56,1:11:16.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,who would approach you, speak his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.82,1:11:19.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,One who wasn't afraid to tell you exactly what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.48,1:11:20.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.99,1:11:23.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I wanted you to be that man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.28,1:11:25.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, why didn't you say something?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.37,1:11:29.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, I'm saying it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.59,1:11:41.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.39,1:11:47.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know it's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.85,1:11:51.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Life hasn't changed that much for Reed, Sue, or Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.60,1:11:54.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least they can still go out in public. But for you...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.44,1:11:57.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to cheer me up, you're doing a hell of a job.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.27,1:11:58.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, Scarface?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.77,1:12:01.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying I know what it's like to lose something that you love...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.69,1:12:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,to see it slip away and know it's never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.78,1:12:04.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.66,1:12:07.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed is gonna fix me up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.70,1:12:11.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,For your sake I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.37,1:12:13.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, he's a brilliant man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.00,1:12:16.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should all trust that he's working as hard as he can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.67,1:12:18.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.96,1:12:22.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,So what possible reason could he have for taking his time?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.05,1:12:27.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, other than spending more time with Sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.76,1:12:34.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wow, I had no idea. - It's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.90,1:12:40.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.69,1:12:42.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have that effect on people.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.15,1:12:45.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.32,1:12:49.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you remember my name now, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.66,1:12:53.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you also remember what you swore to do...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.12,1:12:55.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,with every breath in your body?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.08,1:12:57.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're working as hard as we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.54,1:13:00.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.46,1:13:04.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Victor was right. - Victor?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.34,1:13:08.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, I don't know if this thing will change us back or make us worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.68,1:13:10.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need you to be patient for a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.60,1:13:11.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed, look at me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.76,1:13:14.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am looking. That's why I can't make a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.52,1:13:17.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've gotta get it right and it's not right yet! We need to test it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.27,1:13:20.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I spent my whole life protecting you, and for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.44,1:13:22.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you can play Twister with your girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.65,1:13:24.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,while I'm the freak of the week?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.78,1:13:26.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.57,1:13:30.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You stay out of this, Susie! - Stop it, or I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.66,1:13:33.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off me, rubber boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.16,1:13:35.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys, quit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.39,1:13:54.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.70,1:14:11.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good thing you're flexible enough to watch your own back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.83,1:14:21.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,'Cause I ain't doing it no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.50,1:14:27.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,You two are on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.18,1:14:40.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look what the marketing guys gave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.77,1:14:42.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, check it out, listen. You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.06,1:14:45.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's clobbering time!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.69,1:14:47.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's catchy, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.15,1:14:50.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.41,1:14:55.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was the prototype.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.21,1:15:05.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Johnny, have you seen Ben? - Yeah, Sunshine just left.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.46,1:15:08.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, Sue, I'm sorry. I can't stand this freak show.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.25,1:15:11.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I gotta get back to the real world. - You're calling that the real world?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.63,1:15:14.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue, stop. You're not Mum. Don't talk to me like I'm a little boy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.76,1:15:16.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I would if you stopped acting like one.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.18,1:15:19.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you even hear yourself? Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.18,1:15:22.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone on my ass? If you guys are jealous, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.14,1:15:24.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect it to come from you, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.81,1:15:27.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You really think those people out there care about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.61,1:15:29.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're just a fad to them, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.32,1:15:32.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's try something new. You live your life, I'll live mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.66,1:15:35.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.16,1:15:40.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,And just for the record, they love me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.87,1:16:27.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.04,1:17:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, Reed. What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.50,1:17:13.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can make it work. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.59,1:17:17.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need more power to control the storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.43,1:17:18.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,More power?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.72,1:17:21.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You need a doctor. Come with me. - Sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.10,1:17:23.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- One more try... - You need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.02,1:17:27.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Leonard, bring me our lab rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.02,1:17:34.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.74,1:17:37.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is this? Where's Reed?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.95,1:17:40.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where do you think? With Sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.57,1:17:43.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.79,1:17:45.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.96,1:17:52.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Vic?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.75,1:17:53.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,To help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.05,1:17:57.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,The machine is ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.17,1:17:59.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,But Reed said it wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.63,1:18:01.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,He also said we'd avoid that storm in space...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.05,1:18:04.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,but we all know how that turned out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.64,1:18:08.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,He couldn't generate enough power for the machine to reach critical mass.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.85,1:18:11.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yet another mistake for Mr. Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.77,1:18:14.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And you can? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.03,1:18:20.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.95,1:18:24.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,do you want to be Ben Grimm again?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.39,1:20:10.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.02,1:20:14.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vic?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.08,1:20:30.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vic, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.88,1:20:40.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone thought I was safe behind those shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.55,1:20:44.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.22,1:20:48.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,The machine worked for me. It can work for you, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.97,1:20:51.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It did, Ben. It worked perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.39,1:20:57.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You planned this. - I've always wanted power.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.94,1:21:01.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now I have an unlimited supply.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.28,1:21:04.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,And no Thing to stand in your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.28,1:21:05.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take a good look, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.20,1:21:09.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is what a man looks like who embraces his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.75,1:21:16.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,One down, three to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.96,1:21:18.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vic?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.34,1:21:21.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right on cue.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.46,1:21:23.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.05,1:21:27.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What did you do? - Exactly what I said I would.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.26,1:21:30.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I built a better, stronger being.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.35,1:21:33.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,And outsmarted the great Reed Richards.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.10,1:21:37.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you've exposed yourself to the storm, you're endangering your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.52,1:21:40.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You need help. - You always know best.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.40,1:21:45.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,So tell me, what happens when you superheat rubber?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.30,1:22:10.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.10,1:22:22.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Von Doom, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.73,1:22:24.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never better, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.33,1:22:40.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why the long face? Let's talk in my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.89,1:23:01.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.69,1:23:05.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.98,1:23:07.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, the machine worked!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.53,1:23:10.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me a hand. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.82,1:23:14.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get his arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.49,1:23:18.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You all right, Ben? Put him on the step.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.83,1:23:21.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened, big guy? I leave you for five minutes...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.00,1:23:24.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,The machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.67,1:23:28.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Vic used it on himself. He was affected by the cloud like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.59,1:23:31.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Reed? - Vic must have taken him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.10,1:23:39.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Richards, allow me to begin your lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.72,1:23:41.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Chemistry 101.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.02,1:23:46.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happens to rubber when it's supercooled?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.44,1:23:52.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give up?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.37,1:23:57.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not like you, Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.79,1:24:06.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,After all, we're both doctors.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.84,1:24:10.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Painful?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.88,1:24:12.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't know the meaning of the word.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.14,1:24:23.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a little something from our defence contracts.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.23,1:24:31.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's check in on the rest of the family, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.53,1:24:39.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.08,1:24:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. I got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.25,1:24:48.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't even think about it. - Never do.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.79,1:24:51.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Johnny, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.39,1:25:00.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, flame on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.44,1:25:15.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to help Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.20,1:25:18.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for you now. You have to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.45,1:25:21.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.03,1:26:00.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, think!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.01,1:26:25.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two down, two to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.20,1:26:40.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.74,1:26:45.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What has he done to you? - How romantic.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.12,1:26:49.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.87,1:26:52.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call me Doom.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.29,1:26:57.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,The machine works. It worked on Ben, it can work on you. We can turn you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.26,1:27:01.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you really think fate turned us into gods so we could refuse these gifts?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.47,1:27:04.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor, you always thought you were a god. Now back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.47,1:27:06.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan, let's not fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.64,1:27:07.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Let's.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.02,1:27:15.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan, you're fired!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.99,1:27:27.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marco.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.79,1:27:29.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Polo.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.55,1:27:45.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you say goodbye to your brother Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.35,1:27:52.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.85,1:27:57.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Vic. It's clobbering time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.70,1:28:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn, I've been waiting to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.70,1:28:11.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Susie, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.58,1:28:14.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Victor ain't that bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.67,1:28:19.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,"He's just a little larger than life", right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.80,1:28:22.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe next time you'll listen to me before...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.05,1:28:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.85,1:29:16.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sorry, ladies. - Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.90,1:29:20.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull over. Hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.87,1:29:30.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.87,1:29:34.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put your hands up and step down from the vehicle!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.12,1:29:39.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.55,1:29:47.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies, I'm gonna need to borrow your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.18,1:29:51.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The transmission sticks. - Not gonna be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.93,1:30:30.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.10,1:30:33.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reed?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.85,1:30:37.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.61,1:30:45.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Susan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.86,1:30:49.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You three are pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.37,1:30:59.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,You missed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.75,1:31:04.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Had a little relapse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.92,1:31:08.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Welcome back. - This is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.82,1:31:32.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.83,1:31:46.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnny, supernova!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.46,1:31:47.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought we agreed that was bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.05,1:31:49.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.09,1:31:52.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ben! - Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.10,1:32:03.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue! Think you can contain it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.24,1:32:15.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flame on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.31,1:32:43.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.52,1:32:45.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Time for your lesson. Chem 101.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.06,1:32:48.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happens when you rapidly cool hot metal?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.07,1:32:51.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ben!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.24,1:33:41.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You done good, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.62,1:33:44.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.54,1:33:47.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.33,1:33:49.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.47,1:33:58.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, I love this job.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.72,1:34:01.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Job, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.89,1:34:04.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we do have the suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.70,1:34:27.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies, your drinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.04,1:34:30.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't think we need another. - Just one more.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.50,1:34:33.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you so much. Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.01,1:34:38.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need names and shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.09,1:34:40.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bartender!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.72,1:34:43.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're custom-made, 36 EEEE.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.35,1:34:46.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, look. I've been crunching the numbers on the machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.31,1:34:48.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I think if I can rework the power settings
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.18,1:34:50.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forget about it, egghead. I'm good as is.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.10,1:34:52.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Better than good, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.40,1:34:57.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just need to work on your touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.99,1:34:59.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.53,1:35:05.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I talk to you for a second? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.50,1:35:10.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.55,1:35:19.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I found a broken gasket from space.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.51,1:35:21.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,A gasket?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.84,1:35:25.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Reed, come on, we're at a party. - And if one of us were to wear it...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.11,1:35:36.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,No more thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.03,1:35:38.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,No more variables.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.36,1:35:42.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue Storm...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.66,1:35:44.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.38,1:36:00.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sue, you kind of need to say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.13,1:36:02.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.52,1:36:15.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's my nose, genius. These are my lips.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.90,1:36:23.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's kissing him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.70,1:36:25.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.74,1:36:28.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,About time, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.62,1:36:31.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,No more wisecracks about the way I look.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.25,1:36:35.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Call me Mr. Sensitivity.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.38,1:36:40.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Wide load coming through. Everybody move, he's huge.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.26,1:36:44.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come here, Mr. Sensitive. - Flame on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.39,1:36:49.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Showoff!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.29,1:37:14.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long will it be?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.91,1:37:16.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Should be about 12 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:50.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,《神奇四侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.15,0:01:09.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,为自己建30英尺高的塑像 真是典型的维克多 方杜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:12.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,很明显 是想让那些第一次的来访者...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:16.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,产生一种自惭形秽的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:19.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,好在对我们没用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.99,0:01:23.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,我们干吗来这? 这家伙搞的都是些低级的科学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:26.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你别忘了 我们不是第一次上门求人了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:30.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,再说,维克多也不是太坏 只是有点妄自尊大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:43.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的研究显示暴露在由 日冕太阳风所生成的...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:47.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,高能量的宇宙风暴之下 可能会引发早期行星生命的演化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:53.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,六个星期后 一类似上述特征的云团...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,将经过地球轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:02:00.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,若在太空进行研究 将会从根本上推进...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:03.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们对人类基因组结构的认识 治愈无数疾病...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:07.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,延长寿命,让孩子们活得更长 更壮,更健康
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:10.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,关掉,请
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:12.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我还没把我的提议完全解释清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,已经够清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:17.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一点儿也没变 肩负着全世界...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:19.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,总想着伸手去触摸星辰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:21.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,但帐单不是由梦想来兑现的,不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:28.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,记不记得我们还在学校的时候 说过将来要一起合作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:30.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正要跟你解释这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:33.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个风暴是致命的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:35.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,但你的空间站控制室外的防护罩...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:38.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,是专门设计以保护 里面的人不受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.28,0:02:43.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你要的不光是我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:45.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有我的"玩具"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我,如果宇航局不相信你 那凭什么要我信你?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:56.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,领先一步,这就是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:00.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,洞察别人所看不到的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:01.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可受不了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:03.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,这是做生意,只是工作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是对的,本 这只是生意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:11.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你们都认识 我的基因研究部的主管苏珊 斯多姆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:17.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他比你又多了一样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:19.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨,苏 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:23.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,见到你真好 戴比怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你过的好不好? - 再好不过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:33.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不会是个问题吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 当然不会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:36.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:40.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你正好赶上,能听到 伟大的瑞德 理查德斯...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:43.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,向我求助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗,你曾让很多麻省理工的学生 觉得自己像个科技展上的初中生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一刻让我有点得意 你可别介意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:55.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你若支持这项计划 最后全部成果我会给你一个合理的提成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:57.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,75%
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,附加所有的应用成果和专利权
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:01.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么不把他榨干算了? - 本...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:03.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,十亿美元的百分之二十五 够你们用你一阵了,不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:11.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你还能把巴克斯特大厦的 第四期按接款给付了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:14.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,成交?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:25.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,为了我们的将来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家共同的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,事情变成这样挺有意思的,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:36.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,很滑稽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:42.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,他认识宇航局的人 没准就是他让我们被拒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,想想看要是这件事成了 我们能帮助多少人!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:48.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧,我们已经得到了想要的 这足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:51.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,能在太空中过几天,挺好的事 难道还会变糟?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:05:00.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果瑞德是对的 这次小旅行能让我们的股票翻倍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要是他错了呢? - 他错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:06.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,好在他一直都不清楚其背后的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:18.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,你应该知道太阳风 已经在开始加速了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经把这些因素计算在内了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然,你算过,理论上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦到了太空里 事情就不完全一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我可以向你保证我… - 我们何日升空?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:30.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会负责发射日程的安排...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:33.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你早上可以打电话给我 问关于资源和机组人员的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:37.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我想我记得你的号码 - 换过了已经
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:46.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,至于机组人员的安排 我希望让本做驾驶员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:50.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经雇用了一个飞行员 不过欢迎你来当副手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:52.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,记得我弟弟约翰尼吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.41,0:06:11.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,干不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:15.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,外置固态火箭推进器,轨道系统引擎 和你飞过的航天飞机一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:18.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我可不会听一个内衣模特的指挥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:21.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 本,别这样 - 那臭小子因为带两个"维多利亚秘密"的...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:24.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,内衣女郎偷偷溜进飞行模拟器 而被宇航局扫地出门
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,年轻人好动嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:30.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果撞到墙上去了 飞行模拟器!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么时候有过我要你做件什么事...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说你绝对不能做的?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,五次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:38.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我记得是四次 - 那这是第五次了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:50.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人员请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:53.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,6小时发射倒计时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:55.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经开始想你了,戴比
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,机长驾到!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:04.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,数码相机:264元；记忆棒:59元
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:07.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,从前的硬汉指挥官竟然...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:10.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,成为下属而郁闷的表情:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:11.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,无价
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:16.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,你真好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能搞定这飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也能搞定你这个野心勃勃的黄毛小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我不知道穿上这衣服我是该 飞行还是跳天鹅湖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:27.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是说,谁他妈设计的这个 - 维克多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:31.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,这种人造纤维就像第二层皮肤 可以适应人体的不同需求
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:34.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是说 它能让该热的热...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,该冷的冷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,用可自我调节的不稳定分子制成的材料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:46.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在研究这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,英雄所见略同
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:55.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的,本 - 谢谢你,甜心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:56.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,距宇宙风暴来临还有9小时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:34.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你表现地好 说不定老爸下次会让你飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:37.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,再废话多 就没下次了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:44.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,从发射间到海登天文馆 这一路走来真长啊,对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:51.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,是的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:56.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,从这里我们可以监视云层的靠近 和观察试验
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:58.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,空间站上的防护罩 应该可以保护我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:03.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么了,本? 人老了,变得有点偏执了?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:11.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们开始搬运试验品吧 准备好你的工作服,本
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:15.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看你还在做这些搬运的重活
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:20.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你应该呆在试验室里 现场工作从来就不适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他指挥,我来做 明白?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,那够你忙得了,本
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:31.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你们方便的话 我找苏珊有点事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:43.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,麻烦你告诉我,他不是又想 和我姐姐旧情复燃吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:46.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然不是,纯粹是公事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就好,不过,他的眼神不太对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:54.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,那一次他们两个可都伤透了心 也许她也还没忘了他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:57.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇,心理医生,你还真深刻 试想一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:01.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个是维克多,富可敌国 年度杰出青年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:06.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个是瑞德,世界上最笨的聪明人 一文不名
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:09.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,还真是势均力敌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:11.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就别伤你的小脑筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:13.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,别走丢了,小伙子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,关闭气压隔离舱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我答应瑞德的提议,你很惊讶吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道生意的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:45.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,怪不得人们都寄希望于望未来...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:48.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,它总能帮你为过去划上句点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:55.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊,每个男人都梦想能遇到一个 可以托付整个世界的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我而言,这话不仅仅是个比喻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.29,0:11:06.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,打开观景台防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:43.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,距风暴来临还有9分47秒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:46.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不可能,应该还有7个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在一起也有两年了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:57.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这两年真不错,维克多 你的公司有了这么大的成就
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,当然,公司
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:04.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,但,你瞧,我刚刚意识到 这么多成就若无人分享...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:07.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,那也毫无意义
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:11.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我的人生中 我从不害怕踏出大步
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:14.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在,是我踏出最大一步的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:19.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 维克多 - 就当这是我升你的职
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:22.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 维克多,我… - 我要说四个字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:27.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,四个改变我们一生的字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,云层正在加速!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:32.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,再过几分钟它就过来了 不是几个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,那个风暴有致命危险 要马上中止行动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:38.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,冷静点,我们大老远过来 可不能出一点小问题就慌了神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,关闭防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 本还在外面 - 那就把他收进来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:45.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们到这来是有任务的 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:50.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,瑞德是对的 我们还有不到6分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 本,你马上进来! - 出什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:58.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我活还没干到一半呢,高材生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:59.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,往回走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:10.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟们,我回不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,跳过来,这是唯一的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:20.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么? - 关闭防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不能把他们都留在外面 - 我能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:27.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我都帮不了他们,你又能做什么 - 我可以试!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:44.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,你行的!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,约翰尼,准备好关上入口
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:46.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,醒一醒,本
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:50.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,起床了,太阳照屁股了 大男孩,感觉怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:52.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:55.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,回到地球了,隔离中 维克多的医院里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:57.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德和苏呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:15:00.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们没事,大家都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:03.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:08.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我向你发誓,本 他们已经尽了最大努力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:10.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,也给你做了世界上最好的整容手术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,给你的都是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:14.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把镜子给我 - 我不知道这是不是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:18.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们说单单是精神刺激就… - 我说把那个该死的镜子给我!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:21.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,本,坚强点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:29.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,不幸的是 医生就是无法修复你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.43,0:15:36.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:39.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不错啊,我喜欢你老爷爷的新形象
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:41.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:02.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她怎么样? - 稳定,而且各项生命指数也很强
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,全血球计数显示没有受到辐射,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你过来查这些记录是不是每隔… - 每四个小时,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:11.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们知道我们在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,再观察一天 你们就都可以出院了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:17.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,打扰了 方杜先生又送花了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,她对兰花敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:25.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,放些向日葵在她床边 那是她的最爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:45.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,维克多...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:47.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,银行要恭喜你...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的股票是自经济大萧条 以来掉的最快的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们想送都没人要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:53.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,奈德,你知道我是可以扭转局面的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:56.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你必须扭转,维克多 否则我们就撤资
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:00.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有一周时间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.73,0:17:02.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你幸灾乐祸,对吗?奈德?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:08.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,一周
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:22.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔喔喔,你以为我们要上哪儿去啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道"我们"注意到了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:27.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,阿尔卑斯山这边最疯狂的那些滑雪者 就在我窗户外面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:29.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,我看到了 但是这里有这里的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要等… - 等到测试全部做完
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:36.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我一向都不爱循规蹈矩 结果出来了,你告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:40.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你能帮忙我拉拉链吗? - 你知道,这里可不是滑雪胜地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不是,好在滑雪板 有奶奶用"爱心包裹"给我寄来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:47.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗,真让人惊奇 一个80岁的老奶奶…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:50.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真是麻烦 - 嗯,我的中间名就是麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:51.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好热!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:54.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦?谢谢,你也很热辣 而且我感情丰富,敢于流泪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:55.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是,我是说你好像有点发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一辈子还没感觉这么好过 天哪,你真香
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:00.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,你什么时候下班?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:02.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 4:00,但我… - 那么你听着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:05.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,四点过一分的时候到山顶上来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,给你一分钟的打扮时间 这是你的,那是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,小护士!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:19.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我昏迷了多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:20.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,3天,我真为你担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:26.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 感觉如何? - 挺坚实的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:30.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这次还真惊险,啊? - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:32.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么回事? - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:35.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:39.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我把那些数据反复看了一遍又一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是弄不明白 或许我早该放弃…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:46.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,那是自然界纯偶然的事件 你不可能预测到的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:47.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道吗,死里逃生之后 才能真的让你...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:55.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,为拥有生命中对的那个女人而感激
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:59.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是啊,你和戴比是天生一对 - 我不是在说戴比
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:03.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:05.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,他和维克多挺般配的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:07.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,他聪明,有权势 也成功
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:09.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么,或许你该和他恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:12.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,她和维克多在一起是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:15.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会越来越好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:21.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,是不是每件事都得我亲自来做?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:43.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,我看你就呆在我右边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,在左边可能会有麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:48.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我想还得下降10英尺左右 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后到温泉的人给钱叫客房服务
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:20:00.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是我未来的老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要输了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:31.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,别闹着玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:33.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:42.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,你也挺不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.41,0:20:47.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是,你真的着火了,你看!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:23.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,想一起来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:34.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只能喝一杯,我和维克多约好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:36.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,可不能让维克多久等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:39.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,你在这干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:40.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:45.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了,我们一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:47.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,IPO（首次公开募股）怎么样了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:49.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,还在跌,我们希望能停在20来块的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:52.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个数字还不错 考虑到这次的失败都怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:53.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,怪瑞德捅出来的这个大漏子?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:57.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我联系一个早上的访谈秀,拉里 金的 还有杂志的封面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:01.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得想办法遮住这个伤疤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.32,0:22:05.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,确保他们只从左边拍我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.49,0:22:08.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,事实上,这伤疤还能加深印象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:10.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们似乎觉得它让你 显得更有人情味了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:14.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,还成了好事了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:19.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗,也许你该休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.09,0:22:21.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.55,0:22:23.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先,我还有些未完成的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:26.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一桩买卖要结
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:29.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生,我总是很奇怪,为什么是苏?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:32.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以得到世界上其他任何女人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.31,0:22:35.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,正因为如此 因为我能得到其他的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.39,0:22:39.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,我来说 - 不,让他说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:50.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 可能是虾不新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:53.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我最好去躺躺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.37,0:22:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:58.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.85,0:23:16.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你感觉好点了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:18.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.27,0:23:20.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.61,0:23:24.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就…好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:29.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你总是很会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.79,0:23:37.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,我要走了...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:40.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我约了维克多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我挺为你和维克多高兴的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:46.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的为我和维克多高兴?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.38,0:23:49.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看得出来,你们俩有共同的热爱 也正如我们的恋爱关系中最美好的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.05,0:23:51.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是? - 激情…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.47,0:23:54.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,对科学的激情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:58.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个混蛋,瑞德
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.85,0:24:00.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你从来就没搞清楚...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:03.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你永远也搞不清楚... - 我说什么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.23,0:24:05.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,...除非我用量子物理学来跟你解释
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:06.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只不过想让你知道我…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:09.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经两年了 现在你能说的就只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:11.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为我和什么别的男人在一起而高兴?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.41,0:24:13.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多也许有他不好的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:16.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,但至少他敢于去争取他想要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:18.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,有时候 被人需要的感觉真的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.83,0:24:23.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,受人注视,倾听
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.88,0:24:28.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.88,0:24:31.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.05,0:24:33.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么叫看不到 看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:35.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,快看你的手!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.12,0:25:00.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们绝不会相信刚才发生在我身上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.79,0:25:01.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.29,0:25:05.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,这个我可以解释
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.86,0:25:36.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定是那个风暴云 从根本上改变了我们的DNA
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.32,0:25:37.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们先别忙着做结论
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.99,0:25:40.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,在下结论之前 我们要先掌握大量的证据才行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:42.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔噢,你们看!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.09,0:25:56.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,再想象一下,到处都是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.43,0:25:59.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才就是到处都是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:01.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.56,0:26:05.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个云层确实根本上 改变了我们的DNA
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:09.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 酷! - 我们得去找本
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:11.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有你们知道吗? 我想我刚才飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.49,0:26:19.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,把它灭了,约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.08,0:26:21.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正研究窍门呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.62,0:26:23.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 本,我是瑞德 - 别玩了!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.87,0:26:25.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:26.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是 - 天!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.83,0:26:28.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天? - 你有什么毛病啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.25,0:26:29.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 苏,你知道密码吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.46,0:26:30.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:39.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,开门
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.05,0:26:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧,本?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.18,0:26:43.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们谁有钥匙?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.18,0:26:45.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁有?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.73,0:26:48.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,就把玻璃砸了,不会很厚的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.98,0:26:51.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,再给我点时间 差不多就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.36,0:27:33.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,恶心!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.53,0:27:40.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,本?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.49,0:27:42.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.41,0:27:47.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.83,0:27:51.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.04,0:27:53.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里发生什么事了?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.42,0:27:54.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,你感觉还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.09,0:27:56.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很好,就是有点擦伤,仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.84,0:27:58.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是本干的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.22,0:28:01.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为暴露在那个云层之下 使得他有些反应
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.93,0:28:04.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都有不同的症状
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.43,0:28:05.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,症状?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:08.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 维克多,我本应该… - 找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.48,0:28:14.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人知道那个大家伙 大概会上哪吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.03,0:28:19.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,他回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.00,0:28:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,（大号男装）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.61,0:29:00.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我靠,不是吧!?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.58,0:29:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,按键那么小
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.50,0:29:10.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,接线员,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.42,0:29:16.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 戴比?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.79,0:29:18.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是我 - 本?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:21.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?你的声音有点不同
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.09,0:29:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 听着,我想让你下楼到门前来 - 楼下?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.60,0:29:27.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,你回家了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.97,0:29:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:33.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,有个惊喜要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:38.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也有一个要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.07,0:29:43.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,本?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:48.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.45,0:29:49.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:29:53.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,先别走过来,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.17,0:29:57.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这会有点,有点让人震惊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.42,0:29:59.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.63,0:30:00.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,戴比...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.97,0:30:04.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,记得我们曾说过...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.63,0:30:07.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管发生什么都要永远在一起的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.35,0:30:09.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.89,0:30:12.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:14.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,你别吓我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:29.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.33,0:30:33.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,戴比,是我,我还是我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.25,0:30:34.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是个意外,你听我解释
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:37.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,别过来,别碰我 - 戴比!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:45.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫警察了!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.05,0:30:47.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.26,0:30:49.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看见那个家伙在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.98,0:31:00.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么他昨晚在那
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.36,0:31:02.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,戴比会在桥的另一端和我们碰头
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.21,0:31:18.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,对啊,本
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.96,0:31:21.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,"太空里过几天多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.21,0:31:24.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道还能有什么坏事发生?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.55,0:31:29.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.93,0:31:33.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不怕我,对不对?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.73,0:31:40.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:43.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:31:59.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.63,0:32:03.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为就你有问题? 朋友,你看看我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.96,0:32:06.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,再坏还能怎样,对不对?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.26,0:32:09.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看你不...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.68,0:32:14.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,朋友,放轻松 别,别走到外面去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:16.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说站住,你这果肉蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.18,0:32:18.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,过来点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.64,0:32:21.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,反而远了,过来点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.15,0:32:24.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说,停住!不!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.97,0:32:50.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.91,0:33:16.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.16,0:33:19.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想让我吓唬你?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.75,0:33:21.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好! - 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.84,0:33:33.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,都回去,别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:36.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,回到车上 我们会告诉你们何时可以通行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.76,0:33:39.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们现在怎么办? - 这里人这么多,我们过不去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.06,0:33:41.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过你可以
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.98,0:33:48.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友,弄坏你的卡车,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.19,0:33:51.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要帮忙吗? 你想按那个纽吗,先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:53.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.32,0:33:57.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,你的衣服,把它脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.16,0:33:59.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:01.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可不好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.09,0:34:12.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喔,你有在健身 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.63,0:34:15.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.76,0:34:21.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.98,0:34:23.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.98,0:34:26.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,把那个椅子上的男人放下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.73,0:34:28.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.15,0:34:35.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还有什么好主意?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.61,0:34:38.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么不把衣服脱了 让几百个人盯着你看?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.20,0:34:39.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 苏 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.54,0:34:46.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得去找个心理医生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.29,0:34:50.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.17,0:34:54.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,让一让,让我过去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:35:01.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,现在,呃,往后退
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.98,0:35:06.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,把你的手举起来放在头上...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.11,0:35:16.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,954分队,马上到达事发地点
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.74,0:35:18.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信,你让我出那样的丑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.82,0:35:21.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们总算过来了,不是吗? 找到本再说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.42,0:35:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,本!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.76,0:35:39.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.14,0:36:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,呆在这别动,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.68,0:36:28.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.44,0:36:30.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,坚持住
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.56,0:37:14.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,坚持住!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.20,0:37:22.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我抓住你了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.57,0:38:04.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,趴在地上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.41,0:38:07.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,趴在地上,快!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.71,0:38:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,本
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.57,0:39:29.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我向你保证...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.87,0:39:32.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会尽我所能...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.41,0:39:34.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要我还有一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:38.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就一定让你变回原来的本
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.72,0:39:50.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉你我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.51,0:39:53.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的耳朵上哪去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.56,0:39:59.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,有些人在外面想和你们谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.56,0:40:01.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这件事我们不想公开
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.36,0:40:03.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是科学家,不是名人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.23,0:40:04.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经太晚了,小伙子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.07,0:40:06.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.20,0:40:09.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,...纽约消防队的一辆云梯车...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.20,0:40:10.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,...不幸成了悲剧的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:13.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是今天的焦点不在救援
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.04,0:40:16.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,四人中的一个把身体伸展到惊人的长度...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.62,0:40:19.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是他们给你们取的名字:"神奇四侠"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.04,0:40:22.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 酷 - 等等,你上哪去?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.42,0:40:23.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,去接受采访啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.63,0:40:25.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,别忙,我们先把事情搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.76,0:40:27.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好,那就集体讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.68,0:40:33.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上给我回来,约翰尼!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.77,0:40:38.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,静一静
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.60,0:40:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,真让人不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.11,0:40:44.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们谁是头儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.86,0:40:46.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,正是在下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.57,0:40:48.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.41,0:40:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,小伙子,你上
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.50,0:41:03.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃,在最近一次在 方杜空间站上的行动中...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.59,0:41:08.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被暴露在目前尚不明确的 放射性能量之下
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.80,0:41:10.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 桥上到底发生了什么? - 为什么你的身体可以延展?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.55,0:41:12.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真的可以控制火? - 你能飞,是真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.47,0:41:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,我正在尝试 实际上这很有点难度
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.55,0:41:16.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,事实上,我们现在 所知道的也不比你们多
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.89,0:41:21.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生,拉里 金把访谈取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.60,0:41:23.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,很明显现在有更轰动的头条
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.94,0:41:30.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在,他们来了 朋友们,眼见为实
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.65,0:41:33.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,...神奇四侠...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.28,0:41:36.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会马上到实验室里 去研究分析我们的症状
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.33,0:41:38.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,症状?这难道是一种什么疾病吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.16,0:41:40.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,这不是疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.66,0:41:44.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果说有超能力也是病的话 是,我们病入膏肓了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.71,0:41:47.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,可那个东西看起来可不神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.34,0:41:49.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,本 格莱姆是真正的美国英雄!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.67,0:41:52.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的意思是说每个队伍 都要有个吉祥物嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.34,0:41:57.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,新的时代来临了 这是"神奇四侠"的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.81,0:42:02.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:05.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们到太空去是为了 寻找认识DNA的方法...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.36,0:42:08.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,治愈疾病,挽救生命
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.40,0:42:12.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,但现在,我们的DNA,我们的病 我们的生命悬于一线
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:16.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,别再问了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.83,0:42:20.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是这样扭转局面?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.66,0:42:24.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这几个怪东西占满了头条 而你的公司消息只有在讣告栏里去找?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.62,0:42:26.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是打算利用公众舆论
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.21,0:42:29.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,董事会已经达成一致了 银行已经损失了很多钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:32.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 太迟了,维克多
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.22,0:42:36.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我在这个公司里 投了多少钱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.26,0:42:37.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.35,0:42:40.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是谈判,这是通知
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.43,0:42:43.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要撤资
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.35,0:43:28.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是来看你吧,理查德斯博士?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.56,0:43:29.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,恐怕是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.94,0:43:36.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,别这样,笑一笑嘛 他们都想喜欢你,打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.74,0:43:42.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要吸毒!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.88,0:43:56.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到巴克斯特大厦,理查德斯博士
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.80,0:43:58.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你的,照旧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.01,0:44:00.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.80,0:44:02.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,威利
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.89,0:44:04.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,（最后通知）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.89,0:44:06.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一年我们很艰苦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.31,0:44:08.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,连着九年
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.20,0:44:24.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,要么就是我们上的飞快 要么就是动都没动
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.04,0:44:27.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,（超载）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.04,0:44:34.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爬楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.10,0:44:46.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么本不能像 我们这样随意切换呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.60,0:44:48.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,这正是我们要搞清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.52,0:44:50.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的意思是,如果他是这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.69,0:44:53.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么?你是说我们 也可能不能随意切换?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.44,0:44:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就省时了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.61,0:44:58.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会真想一辈子 都带着火到处跑吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.70,0:45:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是想刁难我吗? - 成熟点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.45,0:45:03.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,少来了,难道就我一个人 觉得这是件挺酷的事吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.66,0:45:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得待在这直到 我们明确自己得变化...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.95,0:45:10.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,和找出撤销的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.38,0:45:17.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我要事先警告你们 有些地方可能会有点挤
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.68,0:45:26.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.64,0:45:31.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道,瑞德 但我想你可能把工作带到家里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.10,0:45:35.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我来,我带你们去你们住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.27,0:45:37.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,大忙人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.03,0:45:47.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,方杜先生,你对最近的 IPO下跌有什么看法?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.74,0:45:49.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么看有关你公司被接管的谣传?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.94,0:46:13.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪,我真替你担心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.77,0:46:16.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,对不起 我没机会给你个打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.65,0:46:18.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,别
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.44,0:46:20.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.65,0:46:24.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经安排好了 把你东西搬到我的公寓楼去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.95,0:46:26.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,那里有24小时的特护
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.70,0:46:28.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,你好意我心领了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.04,0:46:31.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过,我想留在这里和我弟弟一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.33,0:46:34.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到我们对事情有所掌握为止
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.42,0:46:37.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊,我觉得你最好让我的医生 给你检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.67,0:46:40.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,你到这干什么来了?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:44.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也想问这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.18,0:46:48.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你对发生在你们身上的事 有多少了解?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.64,0:46:49.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不多
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.81,0:46:51.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要做些测试 看看损伤的程度
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.10,0:46:55.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,有什么需要我做的你告诉我 我们现在都在一条船上
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.07,0:47:06.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.07,0:47:11.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想说,对不起 这次行动没能像计划中的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.25,0:47:14.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,不像计划中的?它是个大灾难!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.29,0:47:17.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你毁了四个人的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.58,0:47:20.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,客气的说,我们都有责任 我告诉过你中止的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.46,0:47:21.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,中止?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.67,0:47:24.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我把我的公司,我的名誉 几十亿的资金都投了进去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.97,0:47:27.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不能让你把我 弄的像个傻子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.72,0:47:28.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,要是我们能把它搞明白…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.14,0:47:32.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想弄明白 这不是你的什么科研计划
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.47,0:47:34.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想补救它,要快!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.10,0:47:37.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.49,0:47:44.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.90,0:47:47.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题,本
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.91,0:47:51.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,赶快付清你的电费 好回去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.53,0:48:28.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的热能来自于内核
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.70,0:48:30.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,而各项生命指数完全正常
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.78,0:48:33.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,若要找出突变的来源...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.04,0:48:36.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须分离你的重组DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.20,0:48:38.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样我们就能激活定位基因组
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.67,0:48:41.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要给你做个身体检查 看看有什么坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.63,0:48:43.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,你就直说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.30,0:48:46.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的内部器官完全是固态的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.84,0:48:51.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,有多严重啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.80,0:48:53.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道,我以前抽烟的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.60,0:48:57.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不能算是完全的隐身
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.77,0:49:01.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该可以把物体四周的光线挡在外面 甚至是人周围的...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:04.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你能更好地控制地你情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.48,0:49:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.73,0:49:09.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说要是你有更好的自控能力 你就能知道是什么会触发你隐身
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.32,0:49:12.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你记得你当时在桥上的情绪吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.66,0:49:13.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,气愤
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.66,0:49:15.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,激怒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.49,0:49:17.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.75,0:49:20.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,你能不能复制这些情绪?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.25,0:49:21.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,从记忆或者...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.17,0:49:25.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定我能记起一些事来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.55,0:49:27.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有感觉吗? - 没
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.09,0:49:30.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.51,0:49:38.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,比我预想的还要热
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.39,0:49:40.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好了,约翰尼,把温度降下来 - 我还可以更热!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.35,0:49:42.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼,快停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.70,0:49:55.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 约翰尼,立刻停止! - 约翰尼!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.12,0:50:04.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,超凡本领 你们两个真扫兴
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.88,0:50:07.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼你的温度到了4000开了（绝对温标）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.30,0:50:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,再热一点,你就接近超新星了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.63,0:50:11.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 挺好! - 不,不好!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.72,0:50:13.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是太阳的温度
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.64,0:50:15.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,不仅你自己会丧命...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.47,0:50:17.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还会把大气层都点着了...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.26,0:50:19.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,摧毁地球上的一切生物
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.43,0:50:22.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道了,超新星:不好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.57,0:50:31.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样了?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.33,0:50:40.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对不起,你没事吧? - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.83,0:50:42.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真没事吗? - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.54,0:50:43.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.04,0:50:48.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你大概会以为我对你有敌意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.46,0:50:50.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么这么说?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.39,0:50:58.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说,是你要和我分手的 对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.18,0:51:00.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在说笑吗? - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.64,0:51:03.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我清楚地记得 是你离开了我,因此…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.69,0:51:06.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已准备好更进一步的关系,而你没 因此,我离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.90,0:51:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认为情况要比这个复杂点
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.02,0:51:12.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只不过是想和你搬到一起住 有什么好复杂的?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.40,0:51:16.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还有很多变量要考虑 - 不,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.36,0:51:20.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里面只有你和我 没有变量,没有数学
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.45,0:51:22.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上 这是世界上最简单的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.79,0:51:24.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是,瑞德,一如既往 你考虑太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.75,0:51:26.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,我没有 - 那到底是为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.30,0:51:32.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我走的时候你有感觉吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.67,0:51:36.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在有感觉吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.43,0:51:40.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.97,0:51:45.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我们有大麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.78,0:52:00.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,后果会怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.78,0:52:05.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的组织,你的器官 还有你整个的生理结构都在起变化
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.29,0:52:07.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,但不知何故 每个系统都还在正常工作
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.29,0:52:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,它最后会变成?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.96,0:52:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.59,0:52:14.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能是某种有机的合金物质...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.13,0:52:18.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,比钛和钢还要强 比钻石还要硬
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.97,0:52:21.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像瑞德说的那个 可以保护我们的防护罩一样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.94,0:52:28.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要多久
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.31,0:52:31.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,照这个速度,两,三个星期 就会全部感染了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.11,0:52:33.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说全部是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.69,0:52:35.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.36,0:52:38.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能在这里不懂装懂
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.49,0:52:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得向CDC报告
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.66,0:52:43.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 疾病控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.62,0:52:44.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:47.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果这个东西是有传染性的 我们可就遇到大麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.21,0:52:50.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们说得是温疫
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.25,0:52:52.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.50,0:52:55.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有我的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.42,0:52:58.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我代表着一个价值几十亿的公司
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.34,0:53:02.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这件事要保密
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.14,0:53:07.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,你的病情正在发展,正在恶化 我必须通知…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.18,0:53:09.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是个坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.69,0:53:19.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我另有主意
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.39,0:53:51.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的制服同样 暴露在风暴云之下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.06,0:53:53.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,因此它们也可以 像我们一样变形
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.31,0:53:57.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以隐形,或是任意伸展 或是有极强的防火抗高温能力
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.03,0:54:00.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们几个看起来 像80年代的摇滚乐队
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.32,0:54:02.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,要知道这个材料是可以伸缩的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.74,0:54:05.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我相信我一定可以 想到办法让你穿的下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.41,0:54:07.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怀疑,打死我也不会穿的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.29,0:54:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个造型 可是好像还缺了点什么,不够特别
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.62,0:54:11.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们不是戏服
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.87,0:54:14.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能在公众场合用你的超能力,约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.29,0:54:17.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们几个比宇航局还要烦人 - 你会误伤别人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.63,0:54:19.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许还需要条条多功能皮带什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.18,0:54:26.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,呐,找你的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.39,0:54:29.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,需要什么,老兄?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.56,0:54:33.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 斯多姆小姐,那个会隐身的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.52,0:54:36.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你 我的孩子很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.28,0:54:47.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信,又要脱一次!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.33,0:54:58.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,我们真的不能出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.88,0:55:01.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的杂志封面都是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.30,0:55:05.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,我来了,快点说 我今天还有很多地方要去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.26,0:55:07.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,等等,我哪也不去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.14,0:55:11.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼,为了安全起见 我们必须呆在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.81,0:55:15.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,上次听你说的是 只呆一周!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.23,0:55:17.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼,到外面去对你来说太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.52,0:55:18.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,这话你都说了好几年了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.90,0:55:21.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我担心的是 我们的超能力还在演化
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.23,0:55:22.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.44,0:55:26.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就差那么一点就飞起来了 我能体会到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.24,0:55:28.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不能飞 - 目前不
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.24,0:55:30.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼,你能把那个先灭了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.49,0:55:31.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.95,0:55:35.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,你研究地怎么样了? 你打算怎么治我们?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.17,0:55:38.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我打算造一台机器 用它再制造一次风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.46,0:55:42.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,宇宙射线将从这个发生器 传到这个舱里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.17,0:55:44.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,图上怎么没有注释?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.84,0:55:48.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 如果我能反转波段信号… - 这样就能把我们变回正常的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.35,0:55:54.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,不错,可是有什么风险?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.35,0:55:58.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,即使是最小的计算错误 也会导致症状成倍地加深...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.56,0:55:59.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至让我们丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.98,0:56:02.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,送命,这个不好,对不对?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.19,0:56:05.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说就这么得过且过吧,哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.45,0:56:07.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个设备要再过多久才能开始工作?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.95,0:56:09.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不知道,很难说 - 多久?瑞德
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.95,0:56:11.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你不知道?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.87,0:56:14.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不想情况恶化吧 - 比他那样还糟?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.12,0:56:19.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还得被困在这儿一阵子 让我们好好相处,好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.89,0:56:37.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不会敲门吗 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.51,0:57:14.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:22.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天又有更多的 关于方杜集团的负面消息...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.98,0:57:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,耐德 西赛尔宣布 他的投资顾问组将接管...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.40,0:57:27.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,方杜先生的各个科技公司
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.03,0:57:30.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,方杜集团早先的IPO发售...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.32,0:57:32.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,也处于不断下跌的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.20,0:57:37.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,方杜集团将永不可能 克服这一次负面消息的影响...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.23,0:58:00.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.88,0:58:27.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.76,0:58:34.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.18,0:58:40.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些灯怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.39,0:58:43.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于IPO的事 不要太在意
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.52,0:58:45.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝非个人恩怨
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.32,0:58:54.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道你总还可以回 你拉脱维亚的老家去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.11,0:58:56.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,从头再来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.03,0:58:59.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你只属于那里 落后的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.22,0:59:16.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝非个人恩怨,奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.35,0:59:20.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我哪儿也不去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.32,0:59:35.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,...这个赛季到处都是竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.07,0:59:40.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,难以置信 竞技场的观众为之疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.33,0:59:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说,要是有人也能像他们这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.83,0:59:46.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看展翅的雄鹰...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.75,0:59:49.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,那也过来露两手...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.50,0:59:50.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.98,1:00:12.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,帅哥,让我看看你本事
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.99,1:00:19.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的美女姐姐和那怪物呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.62,1:00:23.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.26,1:00:42.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.47,1:00:45.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要你们用最热烈的掌声 欢迎一位特别来宾
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.60,1:00:50.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,来自"神奇四侠"的 约翰尼 斯多姆先生
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:00:58.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,看这个挺身!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.79,1:01:05.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,太神奇了!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.62,1:01:09.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过,约翰尼,这是老一套了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.83,1:01:11.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我们看点新玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.75,1:01:14.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,新玩意
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.96,1:01:17.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.93,1:01:27.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔喔,约翰尼,真精彩
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.39,1:01:29.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是在飞吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.65,1:01:31.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.03,1:01:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,真危险
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.25,1:01:50.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要紧,我没事,我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.83,1:01:52.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,他没事,他很好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.92,1:01:55.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们,约翰尼 斯多姆
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.71,1:01:59.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要为你鼓掌,约翰尼 你可真火
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.89,1:02:13.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他不听话 - 哦,没错,不听话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.65,1:02:16.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 火焰小子从来就不听指挥 - 他把他的制服怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.07,1:02:21.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼,跟我说说你这个服装
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.40,1:02:23.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啊,有点类似于阿玛尼 和宇航员的结合体
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.57,1:02:25.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些超级英雄的名字各是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.45,1:02:28.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们叫我火把人 女士们则叫我火炬
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.33,1:02:31.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他的队员呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.16,1:02:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是隐身女孩 - 女孩?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.17,1:02:36.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你们的头儿,瑞德 理查德斯呢? 听说你们叫他神奇先生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.63,1:02:38.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 估计更难听 - 我想是的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.21,1:02:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们说他可以自由伸展 身体的任何部分,对吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.93,1:02:46.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吧,我也一直觉得他有点 柔
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.22,1:02:50.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?你们怎么称呼那个东西?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.81,1:02:52.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是它的名字了:"东西"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.89,1:02:55.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这还不算太糟 你们没看见他以前的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.40,1:02:57.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这就去宰了他!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.57,1:03:06.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在那!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.29,1:03:16.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 约翰尼 - 我等会再跟你们说,行吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.21,1:03:18.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不行,我们现在就要谈! - 我们可以回家再谈
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.55,1:03:20.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在想什么? - 我的车呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.02,1:03:34.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得这样有意思吗,石头人?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.44,1:03:35.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 约翰尼! - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.56,1:03:37.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你给我们取绰号?你不用脑子的!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.90,1:03:40.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是神奇四侠的脸面?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.19,1:03:42.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,脸面马上就要破相了!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.24,1:03:43.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些能力不是永久性的,约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.86,1:03:45.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,在回复正常之前 我们要格外小心
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.07,1:03:48.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是我不想回复正常呢 我又没变成一个怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.37,1:03:50.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,本!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.42,1:04:01.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚才是不是...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.59,1:04:03.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.76,1:04:05.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 够了,臭小子 - 别,本
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.80,1:04:08.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想飞?那就飞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.10,1:04:17.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,本,别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.94,1:04:19.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们看看石头会不会流血
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.11,1:04:22.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,烧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.23,1:04:23.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们俩暂停一下!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.70,1:04:28.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,去跟那个傻子讲 他起头的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.36,1:04:30.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管,该死的,约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.49,1:04:33.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.75,1:04:35.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.50,1:04:41.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要有点自控 动手之前先想想
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.92,1:04:45.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,但这正是你的问题所在 你总是想,从来不做
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.34,1:04:48.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们得到这些超能力是有原因的呢? 如果这是上天的赋予的责任?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.89,1:04:51.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,责任? 就像泡马子,捞外快?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.30,1:04:52.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有更高的?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.01,1:04:55.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道吗?瑞德 我们就这样了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.93,1:04:57.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,接受它
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.35,1:05:00.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,要么更好,享受它
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.98,1:05:08.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,本,慢一点 他不是有意的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.66,1:05:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道约翰尼,他总是头脑发热
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.78,1:05:14.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,我是烦他们!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.79,1:05:17.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我受不了这样的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.66,1:05:19.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,给瑞德一点时间 你知道他做事的风格了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.12,1:05:22.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,每走一步之前都要分析全局
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.63,1:05:25.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你当然不着急 - 不,不是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.21,1:05:28.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为我再也不用等待瑞德了 但是我...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.22,1:05:34.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们是情况是一样的,本 - 一样?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.85,1:05:39.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,你看看我 你不知道我...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.31,1:05:44.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是多想变成隐身人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.08,1:06:01.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生们,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.92,1:06:05.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就来拿一两样东西...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.59,1:06:07.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我几个朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.80,1:06:11.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,（MK457 热能追踪导弹）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.90,1:06:24.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,（危险:超制冷体）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.61,1:06:26.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,完美!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.80,1:06:57.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一点也不好笑
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.26,1:06:59.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这位是本 格瑞姆
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.97,1:07:02.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一位从布鲁克林到外太空去的人!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.94,1:07:04.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以请尊敬他!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.77,1:07:06.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我照旧,我马上就走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.94,1:07:07.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.11,1:07:11.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 给我双份 - 给他三份
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.82,1:07:16.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 算在我的账上,厄尼 - 知道了,甜心
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.70,1:07:17.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.45,1:07:19.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.29,1:07:26.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系,本
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.42,1:07:28.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果真有上帝的话,他讨厌我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.92,1:07:31.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,她可不讨厌什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.68,1:07:35.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你能看见我的话 你就不会这么说了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.05,1:07:37.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就让我看看你吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.68,1:07:39.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.19,1:07:46.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 慢点 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.50,1:08:10.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么悲伤
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.67,1:08:18.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 与众不同,并不总是坏事
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.56,1:08:23.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,相信我,这次是的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.06,1:08:27.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你不当它是坏事,它就不是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.52,1:08:32.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好了,厄尼,我走了 - 我送你出去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.32,1:08:33.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见,本
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.16,1:08:42.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,顺便告诉你,我叫阿丽西亚
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.92,1:08:49.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,厄尼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.76,1:08:53.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,（维克多·方·杜  拉脱维亚人民感谢你的人道主义贡献）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.76,1:09:01.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德得到了他要的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.81,1:09:03.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他所要的…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.77,1:09:06.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,都从我这里夺走
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.61,1:09:14.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我要把这一切都拿回来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.95,1:09:21.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先,要除掉的是他的保镖
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.26,1:09:38.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个位子有人吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.84,1:09:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来这干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.89,1:09:44.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我担心你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.06,1:09:47.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你担心我? 让人感动
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.31,1:09:50.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,来,你要吃点什么,我请
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.98,1:09:55.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来你需要人陪
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.24,1:10:01.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.54,1:10:11.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我只是想让眼睛休息一下 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.67,1:10:14.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,新出的数据看起来很好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.30,1:10:16.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不够好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.80,1:10:18.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来的测试在什么时候?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.72,1:10:21.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经没有办法了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.09,1:10:24.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我在想也许...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.35,1:10:29.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,总可以拿自己来试验
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.73,1:10:31.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,太仓促了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.69,1:10:34.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 瑞德? - 我得继续工作
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.02,1:10:37.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你需要休息 - 苏,现在不行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.90,1:10:39.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,来,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.95,1:10:44.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,记得我们第一次在这约会?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.87,1:10:47.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好紧张
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.70,1:10:51.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道吗?我给了看门的10美元 让他晚些关门
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.62,1:10:54.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,真的? 我还给了他20美元
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.88,1:10:55.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不是吧? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.25,1:10:57.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 骗我吧? - 是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.17,1:11:01.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真不希望那一夜结束
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.22,1:11:08.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的对,那时候其实不复杂的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.18,1:11:10.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我当时只是没有做好准备...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.23,1:11:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你总是说喜欢...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.56,1:11:16.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,直率的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.82,1:11:19.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,能在你面前说出心里话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.48,1:11:20.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.99,1:11:23.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我想要你成为那个男人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.28,1:11:25.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么从来不说?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.37,1:11:29.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,我现在就说了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.59,1:11:41.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.39,1:11:47.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,这不容易
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.85,1:11:51.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,对瑞德、苏和约翰尼来说 生活没有很大的变化
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.60,1:11:54.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少他们还能抛头露面 但是你...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.44,1:11:57.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你来是想让我开心 那你做的太烂!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.27,1:11:58.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你懂吗,刀疤脸?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.77,1:12:01.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想说 我知道失去钟爱的东西的滋味...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.69,1:12:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着它就这么溜走 再也无法挽回
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.78,1:12:04.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.66,1:12:07.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德会把我治好的,知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.70,1:12:11.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也希望你是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.37,1:12:13.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是个非凡的人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.00,1:12:16.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都应该相信 他会尽他所能地努力工作
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.67,1:12:18.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是他最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.96,1:12:22.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,他有什么理由不抓紧时间?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.05,1:12:27.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说,难道花时间在苏身上?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.76,1:12:34.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喔,我一点也不知道 - 是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.90,1:12:40.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.69,1:12:42.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,人人看到我都是这种表情
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.15,1:12:45.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,本
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.32,1:12:49.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在记得我的名字了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.66,1:12:53.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还记不记得,你曾发过的誓...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.12,1:12:55.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,以你的生命发的誓?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.08,1:12:57.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在尽全力工作了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.54,1:13:00.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,我看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.46,1:13:04.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 维克多是对的 - 维克多?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.34,1:13:08.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,我也不知道现在会让我们恢复 或是变得更糟
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.68,1:13:10.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有点耐心,再给我点时间
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.60,1:13:11.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.76,1:13:14.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在看,正因为这样 我不能出一点错
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.52,1:13:17.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我必须保证它万无一失 可现在还没有,我们还要测试
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.27,1:13:20.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这一生都在维护你 到头来,为了什么?!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.44,1:13:22.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了你可以和你的女朋友谈情说爱...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.65,1:13:24.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我在旁边像个傻子一样等着?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.78,1:13:26.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,住手!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.57,1:13:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这不关你的事,苏 - 你住手,不然就关我的事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.66,1:13:33.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你给我下来,橡皮小子
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.16,1:13:35.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们俩,都住手!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.39,1:13:54.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.70,1:14:11.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的是你足够灵活 能够自保
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.83,1:14:21.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我不会在保你了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.50,1:14:27.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们两个靠自己吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.18,1:14:40.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,看,这是那些做市场推广的人给我的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.77,1:14:42.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧,你会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.06,1:14:45.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,来打架吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.69,1:14:47.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,很上口,对不对
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.15,1:14:50.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,多好玩啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.41,1:14:55.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,这个是原始模型!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.21,1:15:05.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 约翰尼,你看见本了吗? - 是啊,太阳公公刚离开
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.46,1:15:08.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,对不起 我不能再呆在这个傻瓜秀里了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.25,1:15:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我得回到真实的世界里去 - 你说那个是真实的世界?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.63,1:15:14.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,住口,你不是老妈 别把我当小男孩,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.76,1:15:16.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以,但你要先有个大人样
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.18,1:15:19.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道你在说什么吗? 你以为你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.18,1:15:22.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么你们都烦我? 如果他们几个是忌妒我,没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.14,1:15:24.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽管我没指望你们会嫉妒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.81,1:15:27.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的以为外面那些人喜欢你?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.61,1:15:29.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不过是拿你当消遣,约翰尼
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.32,1:15:32.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来点新的 你过你的生活,我过我的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.66,1:15:35.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,没意见吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.16,1:15:40.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且记录备案,他们喜欢我!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.87,1:16:27.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,天,瑞德
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.04,1:17:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,我的天哪,瑞德,你做了什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.50,1:17:13.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我能成功 - 不
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.59,1:17:17.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要更多的电能来控制风暴
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.43,1:17:18.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,更多的电能?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.72,1:17:21.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你需要一个医生,跟我来 - 苏
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.10,1:17:23.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再试一次... - 你需要休息
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.02,1:17:27.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,莱纳德,把试验鼠带来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.02,1:17:34.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,本,请进
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.74,1:17:37.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?瑞德呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.95,1:17:40.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为呢?他和苏在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.57,1:17:43.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来接手,莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.79,1:17:45.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,先生
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.96,1:17:52.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要怎样?维克?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.75,1:17:53.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.05,1:17:57.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,设备已经好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.17,1:17:59.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是瑞德说…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.63,1:18:01.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还说了我们可以躲过 太空中的风暴的...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.05,1:18:04.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们都知道结果如何了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.64,1:18:08.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不能生成足够的电能 所以这个设备就不能达到临界质量
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.85,1:18:11.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是神奇先生犯的又一个错误
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.77,1:18:14.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你可以? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.03,1:18:20.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.95,1:18:24.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想变回为本 格莱姆吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.39,1:20:10.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.02,1:20:14.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.08,1:20:30.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.88,1:20:40.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人都以为我在防护罩后面 就是安全的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.55,1:20:44.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.22,1:20:48.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个机器在我身上能成功 也能把你治好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.97,1:20:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,对啊,本,它在我身上也成功了 非常成功
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.39,1:20:57.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这一切都是你的安排 - 我总想得到力量
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.94,1:21:01.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我有了无穷的源泉
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.28,1:21:04.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么都挡不了你的路
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.28,1:21:05.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好看看,本
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.20,1:21:09.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样的才是男人 拥抱他的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.75,1:21:16.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞定了一个,还有三个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.96,1:21:18.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.34,1:21:21.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.46,1:21:23.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,本?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.05,1:21:27.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你都干了些什么? - 正如我所说的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.26,1:21:30.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我创造了一个更好 更强壮的物种
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.35,1:21:33.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我比伟大的瑞德 理查德斯更聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.10,1:21:37.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你让你自己暴露在风暴之下 会危及你的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.52,1:21:40.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你需要帮助 - 你总是什么都知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.40,1:21:45.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么告诉我,如果超高温加热橡胶 会怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.30,1:22:10.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.10,1:22:22.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,方杜先生,你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.73,1:22:24.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,再好不过了,吉米
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.33,1:22:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么拉长了脸,不高兴? 我们到我的办公室里谈
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.89,1:23:01.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,本
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.69,1:23:05.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.98,1:23:07.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼,这个机器起作用了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.53,1:23:10.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我一把
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.82,1:23:14.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓着胳膊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.49,1:23:18.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧,本?把他放到台阶上
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.83,1:23:21.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了,大家伙 我们才离开了五分钟...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.00,1:23:24.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个机器
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.67,1:23:28.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多把它用在他自己身上 像我们一样,他也受了风暴云的影响
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.59,1:23:31.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 瑞德在哪儿? - 一定是被维克带走了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.10,1:23:39.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,理查德斯博士 请允许我开始给你上课
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.72,1:23:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,化学知识 第一章
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.02,1:23:46.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,橡胶在超低温的环境下 会怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.44,1:23:52.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,放弃吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.37,1:23:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可不像你,瑞德
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.79,1:24:06.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,毕竟我们俩都是博士
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.84,1:24:10.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,痛苦?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.88,1:24:12.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还不懂这个词的真正含义
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.14,1:24:23.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,给你看看我从国防部拿到的新玩意
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.23,1:24:31.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在来关注一下剩余的家庭成员 怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.53,1:24:39.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.08,1:24:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有个办法
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.25,1:24:48.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 想都别想 - 从来就不想
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.79,1:24:51.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干什么!约翰尼,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.39,1:25:00.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,快,快点,火来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.44,1:25:15.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须去救瑞德
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.20,1:25:18.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在对你来说,太危险了 你留在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.45,1:25:21.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都干了些什么
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.03,1:26:00.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,快,想想!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.01,1:26:25.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞定了两个,还有两个
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.20,1:26:40.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.74,1:26:45.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他都对你做了些什么? - 真浪漫
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.12,1:26:49.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,请不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.87,1:26:52.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫我 杜（末日）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.29,1:26:57.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个机器成功了 它可以把本变会来,你也可以
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.26,1:27:01.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们真以为命运把我们变成上帝 维克多,你一直就以为自己是上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.47,1:27:04.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,维克多,你一直就以为自己是上帝 你走开
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.47,1:27:06.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,我们不要打架
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.64,1:27:07.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我们打
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.02,1:27:15.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊,你被解雇了!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.99,1:27:27.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,马可
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.79,1:27:29.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,波罗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.55,1:27:45.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,和你弟弟说再见了?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.35,1:27:52.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,是时候结束了!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.85,1:27:57.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,维克,该打架了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.70,1:28:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的,就等着这一刻呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.70,1:28:11.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,你还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.58,1:28:14.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,"维克多也不算太坏,啊?"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.67,1:28:19.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,"他就是有点妄自尊大",对不对?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.80,1:28:22.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许下次你该先听听我的...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.05,1:28:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,本!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.85,1:29:16.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对不起,女士们 - 停车
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.90,1:29:20.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠边,踩刹车
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.87,1:29:30.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,警察
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.87,1:29:34.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,举手然后下车出来!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.12,1:29:39.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,开枪!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.55,1:29:47.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们,借你们的车用一下
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.18,1:29:51.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 变速杆是坏的 - 这个没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.93,1:30:30.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能让你这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.10,1:30:33.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞德?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.85,1:30:37.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就轮到你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.61,1:30:45.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好,苏珊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.86,1:30:49.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们三个可怜虫
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.37,1:30:59.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,少了我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.75,1:31:04.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,又聚到一起了,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.92,1:31:08.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回来 - 这将会很有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.82,1:31:32.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我支持不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.83,1:31:46.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰尼,超新星!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.46,1:31:47.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得我们一致认为那个东西不好
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.05,1:31:49.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.09,1:31:52.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 本! - 接住你了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.10,1:32:03.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,看你能不能包住它
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.24,1:32:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,燃烧吧,火鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.31,1:32:43.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就这点儿本事吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.52,1:32:45.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在给你上一课 化学知识 第一章
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.06,1:32:48.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,给热金属快速冷却会怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.07,1:32:51.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,本!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.24,1:33:41.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得不错,小子
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.62,1:33:44.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.54,1:33:47.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.33,1:33:49.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.47,1:33:58.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱死这个工作了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.72,1:34:01.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,工作?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.89,1:34:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过,我们的确有制服啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.70,1:34:27.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们,你们的酒
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.04,1:34:30.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我看我们已经喝够了 - 再喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.50,1:34:33.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,十分感谢,干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.01,1:34:38.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我你们的名字 还有你们要喝几杯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.09,1:34:40.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,酒保!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.72,1:34:43.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,特别定制的,36号,4倍E码
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.35,1:34:46.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说,我一直在分析机器上的数据
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.31,1:34:48.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想如果我可以重新调整能量
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.18,1:34:50.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,算了,我现在挺好
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.10,1:34:52.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可不只是一般的好,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.40,1:34:57.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得好好练习你的力度
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.99,1:34:59.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个声音
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.53,1:35:05.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我能跟你谈一会儿吗? - 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.50,1:35:10.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.55,1:35:19.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在太空里找到一个破垫圈
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.51,1:35:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,垫圈?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.84,1:35:25.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦,瑞德,我们在开派对 - 我想我们中的一个也许可以戴着它...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.11,1:35:36.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,不再有更多的考虑
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.03,1:35:38.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,不再有更多的变量
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.36,1:35:42.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.66,1:35:44.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.38,1:36:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,苏,总得说些什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.13,1:36:02.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.52,1:36:15.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我的鼻子,天才 这才是我的嘴唇
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.90,1:36:23.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们在接吻
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.70,1:36:25.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.74,1:36:28.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,正是时候,伙计们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.62,1:36:31.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,不许再对我的样子说三道四了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.25,1:36:35.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫我敏感先生
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.38,1:36:40.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,注意,大型卡车过来了,大家让路
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.26,1:36:44.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你给我过来,敏感先生 - 火来
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.39,1:36:49.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱现!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.29,1:37:14.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,要多久?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.91,1:37:16.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,大约12天
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.91,1:37:52.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,（拉脱维亚）
